# Raw-asset staging folder at repo root (local-only by design).
# Holds source PNG exports and downloaded SFX before they are imported into
# the asset catalog / DesignerAna/SoundEffects/, which ARE tracked and used by
# the build. Leading slash anchors to repo root so DesignerAna/SoundEffects/
# is NOT ignored. Back up _RawAssets/ separately — git does not version it.
/_RawAssets/
